{
	// NEVR-586 — knip dead-code gate on apps/web (Multica #10331 pattern:
	// make the detector blocking while the surface is young). The gate command
	// is `bunx knip --workspace apps/web` (pinned knip in the root
	// devDependencies); zero findings is the baseline, recorded by
	// tests/bun/web-knip-gate.test.ts.
	//
	// Workspace map:
	// - "." exists only to give the root-level bun test suite (tests/bun) a
	//   real consumer graph. Its test files import apps/web modules directly
	//   (web-dev-timing-hygiene.test.ts consumes the NEVR-544 F5 surface in
	//   lib/dev-timing-hygiene.ts; design-contracts.test.ts seeds probes into
	//   apps/web/src), and `--workspace apps/web` tracks that cross-workspace
	//   usage — so those exports stay green without per-symbol ignores.
	// - "apps/web" carries no ignores: every finding from the NEVR-583 trial
	//   report was deleted or un-exported, nothing is suppressed.
	"$schema": "./node_modules/knip/schema.json",
	"workspaces": {
		".": {
			"entry": ["tests/bun/**/*.test.ts"]
		},
		"apps/web": {}
	}
}
